3D
To modify the 3D effect depth, touch the 3D button on the bottom right corner of the screen. The Zoom slider on the right side of the screen will change to 3D effect slider. Move it up to increase the depth and down to reduce it. Press the 3D button again to turn the slider back into zoom mode.
